Arnold light groups authored with arnold primvars mixed with UsdLux light linking, with a mesh light in the scene

see #2835

Same as test_2835, with a center sphere and UsdLux light link collections on the dome lights: the blue dome is linked
to the center sphere only, the red dome to the right sphere only. The arnold light groups (primvars:arnold:light_group)
of the left and right spheres take precedence over the collections: the left sphere is blue and green, the center one
blue and green (the mesh light has no collection), the right one red and green.

author: cyril.pichard

PARAMS: {'scene': 'scene.usda'}
